# SOPS recipients allow-list — Gate 7
#
# This file is the committed source of truth for which age public keys are
# authorised to receive SOPS-encrypted secrets. The `gate-7-recipients` job in
# .github/workflows/security.yml diffs this file against .sops.yaml on every CI
# run; a mismatch fails the build.
#
# Order must match .sops.yaml creation rules exactly:
#   - dev: CI, operator1, operator2
#   - staging: CI, operator1, operator2
#   - prod: operator1, operator2 (NO CI key)
#   - k8s secrets: CI, operator1, operator2
#   - terraform vars: CI, operator1, operator2

